---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Consulting | Moises Salgado"
  description="Remote sensing, geoprocessing and geospatial and climate intelligence consulting, through Coordenada Geo."
  alt="/consultoria"
>
  <header class="container page-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Consulting</p>
    <h1>Remote sensing and geoprocessing</h1>
  </header>

  <section class="container card reveal">
    <p>
      I design and implement systems that turn satellite data, land use and climate variables into decision-ready information
      for the private sector, government and impact organizations.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Geospatial architectures, WebGIS and spatial data infrastructure</li>
      <li>Satellite-based land use and land-use change monitoring</li>
      <li>Greenhouse gas inventories and climate and carbon frameworks</li>
      <li>AI models applied to remote sensing</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="container card reveal">
    <h2>Credentials</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Former CTO and co-founder of Agrosatélite (acquired by Serasa Experian in 2023)</li>
      <li>Co-created the MapBiomas croplands and planted forests methodologies</li>
      <li>Coordinated IT and database for the LULUCF inventory in Brazil's Fourth National Communication to the UNFCCC</li>
      <li>10+ years leading technology, product and R&amp;D in geospatial intelligence</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://coordenadageo.com.br" rel="noreferrer">coordenadageo.com.br</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:contato@moisessalgado.com.br">contato@moisessalgado.com.br</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
